@startuml c4-codigo-envio
title C4 nivel 4 · Código del envío formal de un manuscrito

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ClassBorderColor #438DD5
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty members
set namespaceSeparator none

package "apps.publications.views" {
  class ManuscriptSubmitView <<vista>> {
    + post(request, pk) : Response
    - idempotency_scope(request, request_hash_of)
  }
}

package "apps.publications.services" {
  class submit_manuscript <<servicio>> {
    manuscript_id, user, idempotency_key,
    context, idempotency
  }
  class IdempotencyScope <<servicio>> {
    + find() : StoredResponse
    + lock_and_find() : StoredResponse
    + store_result(result)
  }
  class PdfService <<servicio>> {
    + validate(source) : PdfInfo
    + sanitize(source, destination)
  }
  class storage <<módulo>> {
    + allocate_version_dir(manuscript_id, version_number)
    + copy_exclusive(source, destination) : CopyResult
    + write_exclusive(path, data)
  }
  class snapshot <<módulo>> {
    + build_metadata_snapshot(manuscript)
    + canonical_json(snapshot)
    + metadata_sha256(canonical)
  }
  class missing_requirements <<servicio>> {
    manuscript : Manuscript
  }
}

package "apps.audit" {
  class AuditService <<servicio>> {
    + record(action, entity_type, result, actor, ...)
  }
}

package "apps.publications.models" {
  class Manuscript {
    code
    status
    lock_version
    is_active
  }
  class ManuscriptVersion <<append-only>> {
    version_number
    round_number
    original_sha256
    metadata_sha256
  }
  class CorrectionRound {
    round_number
    opened_at
  }
  class StatusEvent <<append-only>> {
    from_status
    to_status
  }
}

ManuscriptSubmitView ..> IdempotencyScope : reintento seguro
ManuscriptSubmitView --> submit_manuscript : llama
submit_manuscript ..> missing_requirements : valida metadatos
submit_manuscript --> PdfService : valida y sanea el PDF
submit_manuscript --> storage : copia sin sobrescribir
submit_manuscript --> snapshot : congela los metadatos
submit_manuscript --> AuditService : misma transacción
submit_manuscript ..> IdempotencyScope : guarda la respuesta
submit_manuscript --> Manuscript : DRAFT → SUBMITTED
submit_manuscript --> ManuscriptVersion : crea la versión 1
submit_manuscript --> CorrectionRound : abre la ronda 0
submit_manuscript --> StatusEvent : registra la transición

Manuscript "1" o-- "*" ManuscriptVersion
Manuscript "1" o-- "*" CorrectionRound
Manuscript "1" o-- "*" StatusEvent

note right of submit_manuscript
  Una sola transacción:
  si falla cualquier paso
  (archivo, base o auditoría)
  no queda nada a medias.
end note
@enduml
